  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9ab0ef597bb29a74",
      "translationZh": "推出 /goal | SpaceXAI",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef1623482c16509e",
      "translationZh": "使用 /goal，在 Grok Build 中自主执行长时间运行的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d5d7e3f63c0e6c35",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们在 Grok Build 中推出 /goal。这一新模式支持长时间自主执行，帮助你将规模更大的实现任务交给智能体。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3dfcf63b0bbd6b05",
      "translationZh": "大多数编码会话都需要反复执行和验证。使用 /goal，智能体会持续工作，直到任务完成并通过验证，无论这意味着审查代码、检查网页，还是执行脚本。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3c85031601caea9a",
      "translationZh": "用一行文字设定目标",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc247b46627206c5",
      "translationZh": "给 /goal 一个目标，接下来就交给 Grok Build：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4d3d2de4eed0baa9",
      "translationZh": "它会规划方案，将工作拆解成进度检查清单，然后开始执行。在它工作的过程中，你可以继续向智能体提供额外指令。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5b4d068f9e3595f8",
      "translationZh": "这一新模式提供了额外的命令，用于监控和引导长时间运行的任务：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8d121385b9ce4fc5",
      "translationZh": "目标完成后，面板会切换为 Complete 状态，清单中的每一项都会被勾选。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "640c9afc5048f39b",
      "translationZh": "使用上面的命令安装 Grok Build，然后调用 /goal，交付你的第一个长时间运行的任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
